[[2,1,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Raise the vehicle.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752828\">Op. 4450B08 RIGHT REAR WHEEL R R</a></p><p>1. Drain the brake fluid</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169000700.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,524288,"<p>1. Undo both connectors (1a) and (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the brake pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169000701.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,524288,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the pipe and tighten the connectors to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>1.6</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Top up the brake fluid and bleed the system.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752828\">Op. 4450B08 RIGHT REAR WHEEL R R</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]